Changed: Suggi, 2026-11-21: new standing orders (command the most dominant fleet; dominate the galaxy and all other factions) and a medium-term goal G5 (a roster of 500, all of it in the faction); P4 now climbs to 500 seats; Apollo names the buildings he wants for it.
In force from this entry until a newer one.
STANDING ORDERS (Suggi; set and changed by him alone)
